  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote private investment in pig and poultry sector - PI-PPS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Promote private investment in pig and poultry sector - PI-PPS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Livestock Master Plan (LMP) aims to increase the production of small livestock and to do so through private sector investors and through small holder farmers in Rwanda. A critical component of the plan is to ensure that the small holders are supported in a way that ensures that they have access to technical assistance and are linked to those adding value and to final markets where their animals (live) or processed products can be sold.  INTERVENTION 2. ATTRACT PRIVATE INVESTMENT SPECIFIC OBJECTIVE: ATTRACT PRIVATE INVESTMENT TO DEVELOP A MODERN VALUE CHAIN TO PRODUCE HIGH QUALITY MEAT PRODUCTS AND EGGS TO SUBSTITUTE IMPORT AS WELL AS TO EXPORT</narrative>
  </description>
